    <!--
    The daily loop's copy. Each string says where it comes from:
      copy.md / states.md: the design system's corpus (copy.md's table is authoritative).
      FIGMA NODE NAME: the auto-name of a Figma text node (not verified `characters`).
      PROPOSED: written in this PR, not yet approved by the owner. Never shipped unreviewed.
    Placeholders are positional (%1$s) because Compose resources have no named form; the
    comment names each one, and no string is ever concatenated. No em or en dashes, no
    exclamation marks (copy.md).
    -->

